@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-privately-with-local-synthetic-test-token
@familyId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Current member: live sleep/feed entries only, with row versions and current grant/history.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/families/{{familyId}}/sleep-feed-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Anonymous callers receive 401; this request never grants access or changes records.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/families/{{familyId}}/sleep-feed-snapshot
Accept: application/json

### An admitted nonmember or a removed member receives 403 membership_revoked.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/families/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222/sleep-feed-snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
